<div class='single' id='post'>
<div class='title'>
<a name='491143999961028615'></a>
<h2>
<a href='http://georgiatechhts.blogspot.com/2016/04/say-hello-to-new-hsoc-website-and-blog.html'>Say Hello to the NEW HSOC Website and Blog</a>
</h2>
<div class='date'>
<span class='author'>
Posted by
<span class='fn'>Admin</span>
</span>
<span class='clock'>

        On
      
5:08:00 PM
</span>
<span class='comm'>
<a class='comment-link' href='http://georgiatechhts.blogspot.com/2016/04/say-hello-to-new-hsoc-website-and-blog.html#comment-form' onclick=''>54
comments</a>
</span>
</div>
</div>
<style>.fullpost{display:none;}</style>
<div class='entry'>
The School of History and Sociology has gotten a makeover! &nbsp;Go to <a href="http://www.hsoc.gatech.edu/">www.hsoc.gatech.edu</a> to check out the new look of the website.<span class="&#8221;fullpost&#8221;"></span><br />
<div>
<br /></div>
<div>
With the website change, the blog is moving too. &nbsp;From now on, you can follow the HTS Undergraduate Student Blog at <a href="http://www.hsoc.gatech.edu/undergrad-blog">www.hsoc.gatech.edu/undergrad-blog</a>. &nbsp;The old blog (this one!) will stay live and all the posts will remain, so don't worry if you forgot to jot down a deadline or make note of an internship opportunity. &nbsp;The information is still there!</div>
<div>
<br /></div>
<div class="separator" style="clear: both; text-align: center;">
<a href="https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-1aZBr0nv_OU/VxlBS3u5-yI/AAAAAAAAD2I/tGnJobX314YPIjfCcNEQcR5KziTie488ACLcB/s1600/Screen%2BShot%2B2016-04-21%2Bat%2B5.08.00%2BPM.png" imageanchor="1" style="clear: left; float: left; margin-bottom: 1em; margin-right: 1em;"><img border="0" height="578" src="https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-1aZBr0nv_OU/VxlBS3u5-yI/AAAAAAAAD2I/tGnJobX314YPIjfCcNEQcR5KziTie488ACLcB/s640/Screen%2BShot%2B2016-04-21%2Bat%2B5.08.00%2BPM.png" width="640" /></a></div>
<div>
<br /></div>
<div style='clear: both;'></div>
<div style='clear'></div>
</div>
<br/>
<div class='singleinfo'>
<div class='more'>
<a href='http://georgiatechhts.blogspot.com/2016/04/say-hello-to-new-hsoc-website-and-blog.html'>READ MORE > </a>
</div>
