</h2>
<div class='date'>
<span class='author'>
Posted by
<span class='fn'>Admin</span>
</span>
<span class='clock'>

        On
      
12:02:00 PM
</span>
<span class='comm'>
<a class='comment-link' href='http://georgiatechhts.blogspot.com/2016/04/student-honors-celebration.html#comment-form' onclick=''>0
comments</a>
</span>
</div>
</div>
<style>.fullpost{display:none;}</style>
<div class='entry'>
<div class="separator" style="clear: both; text-align: center;">
<a href="https://3.bp.blogspot.com/-b7RPepQ0m2A/VxeoCDnC6NI/AAAAAAAABZ8/rZZC4oIEv6sT3nNIZR2nJe5i_VvsdSHzACLcB/s1600/student%2Bhonors%2Bcelebration.jpg" imageanchor="1" style="clear: left; float: left; margin-bottom: 1em; margin-right: 1em;"><img border="0" height="133" src="https://3.bp.blogspot.com/-b7RPepQ0m2A/VxeoCDnC6NI/AAAAAAAABZ8/rZZC4oIEv6sT3nNIZR2nJe5i_VvsdSHzACLcB/s200/student%2Bhonors%2Bcelebration.jpg" width="200" /></a></div>
The Student Honors Celebration recognizes students who have achieved academic and scholastic excellence in their programs of study at Georgia Tech. All student award recipients and their guests are invited to attend this celebration. An RSVP is required to attend this event.<span class="&#8221;fullpost&#8221;"></span><br />
<div>
<br /></div>
<div>
For more information click <a href="http://www.specialevents.gatech.edu/events/student-honors">here</a>.</div>
