<h2>
<a href='http://georgiatechhts.blogspot.com/2016/04/spring-faculty-and-staff-luncheon-awards.html'>Spring Faculty and Staff Luncheon Awards</a>
</h2>
<div class='date'>
<span class='author'>
Posted by
<span class='fn'>Admin</span>
</span>
<span class='clock'>

        On
      
11:58:00 AM
</span>
<span class='comm'>
<a class='comment-link' href='http://georgiatechhts.blogspot.com/2016/04/spring-faculty-and-staff-luncheon-awards.html#comment-form' onclick=''>2
comments</a>
</span>
</div>
</div>
<style>.fullpost{display:none;}</style>
<div class='entry'>
<div class="separator" style="clear: both; text-align: center;">
<a href="https://3.bp.blogspot.com/-6jJ-FOH8JfQ/Vxem8yqegJI/AAAAAAAABZw/2EGiUo__KcIABkYVFiEdujcqcBdZajHNACLcB/s1600/hsoc%2Baward%2Bluncheon.jpg" imageanchor="1" style="clear: left; float: left; margin-bottom: 1em; margin-right: 1em;"><img border="0" height="213" src="https://3.bp.blogspot.com/-6jJ-FOH8JfQ/Vxem8yqegJI/AAAAAAAABZw/2EGiUo__KcIABkYVFiEdujcqcBdZajHNACLcB/s320/hsoc%2Baward%2Bluncheon.jpg" width="320" /></a></div>
Faculty, staff, students, alumni, and friends of the College gathered to celebrate the end of the year at the Spring Faculty and Staff Luncheon on Tuesday, April 19.<br /><br />Dean <a href="http://www.iac.gatech.edu/people/faculty/royster">Jacqueline Royster</a> led the program and recognized the accomplishments of the College throughout the year.<div>
<br />See more at: <a href="http://www.iac.gatech.edu/news-events/stories/526901#sthash.swSKFTPB.dpuf">http://www.iac.gatech.edu/news-events/stories/526901#sthash.swSKFTPB.dpuf</a><span class="&#8221;fullpost&#8221;"></span></div>
<div style='clear: both;'></div>
<div style='clear'></div>
</div>
<br/>
