<span class='comm'>
<a class='comment-link' href='http://georgiatechhts.blogspot.com/2016/04/11th-annual-undergraduate-research.html#comment-form' onclick=''>0
comments</a>
</span>
</div>
</div>
<style>.fullpost{display:none;}</style>
<div class='entry'>
Undergraduate research at Tech will be showcased on Tuesday, April 19th (tomorrow) at the 11th Annual Undergraduate Research Symposium <a href="http://urop.gatech.edu/2016-symposium">http://urop.gatech.edu/2016-symposium</a>  in the Student Center Ballroom and surrounding rooms.   Approximately 200 students will present their work on medical advances in multiple fields, sustainable building design, regeneration, even a wristband that digitizes handwriting on 2D surfaces,  plus much, much more!  Over 160 presentations with reception to follow (presentations 1-4:30pm | reception 4:30-6pm). The full symposium program is online&nbsp;<a href="http://urop.gatech.edu/sites/default/files/images/11th_annual_undergraduate_research_spring_symposium_awards_program_book.pdf">here</a>.<span class="&#8221;fullpost&#8221;"></span><br />
